      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 2.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 3.06,
      "end_seconds": 7.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Alright, that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 9.6,
      "end_seconds": 14.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.18,
      "end_seconds": 22.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "Yeah, it's attacks of spinning lasting hours. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.52,
      "end_seconds": 26.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.86,
      "end_seconds": 34.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "about about a month give or take"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 36.04,
      "end_seconds": 40.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "I think it's been nearer about two months actually"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.22,
      "end_seconds": 46.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly one to two months. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.59,
      "end_seconds": 51.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Ah you know I suppose so yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.6,
      "end_seconds": 58.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Alright would you say mild moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.86,
      "end_seconds": 70.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.49,
      "text": "I, I'd say moderate. Uh, I've also had a full feeling in the ear, for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.95,
      "end_seconds": 73.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "have you had hearing getting worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.05,
      "end_seconds": 76.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "yes, since last weekend"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.53,
      "end_seconds": 83.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "What about ringing in the left ear have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.25,
      "end_seconds": 87.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "yeah. Two months, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.61,
      "end_seconds": 97.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.97,
      "end_seconds": 103.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Yeah, no, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.78,
      "end_seconds": 108.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.47,
      "end_seconds": 113.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "oh, I'm allergic to tramadol, I get vomiting"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.28,
      "end_seconds": 117.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.58,
      "end_seconds": 127.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "I've had depression for about a year now. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.36,
      "end_seconds": 129.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.38,
      "end_seconds": 132.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "yes, migraines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.38,
      "end_seconds": 134.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.42,
      "end_seconds": 146.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly including from the pharmacy?"
