    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.74,
      "end_seconds": 162.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 164.23,
      "end_seconds": 176.12,
      "duration_seconds": 11.89,
      "text": "it's 10 milligrams sorry, you know, what was I saying, it's sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed for my migraines, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.68,
      "end_seconds": 181.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.66,
      "end_seconds": 194.46,
      "duration_seconds": 10.8,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.4,
      "end_seconds": 209.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "have you had any headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.99,
      "end_seconds": 212.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "no no headache"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 213.65,
      "end_seconds": 218.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "actually, doctor, I did notice headache she doesn't always say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.66,
      "end_seconds": 225.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.63,
      "end_seconds": 235.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "alright I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed did you get double vision ear discharge or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.28,
      "end_seconds": 240.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "no, no double vision, ear discharge or weakness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.78,
      "end_seconds": 247.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "How are your bowels any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.04,
      "end_seconds": 251.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "nothing unusual, you know, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 252.98,
      "end_seconds": 260.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pressure 114 over 79, temp 36.9 degrees, pulse is 69 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.94,
      "end_seconds": 263.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.44,
      "end_seconds": 269.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "right, let's have a proper look at you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.79,
      "end_seconds": 273.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.26,
      "end_seconds": 291.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "the ear drums look normal and the hearing is reduced on the left"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.11,
      "end_seconds": 317.59,
      "duration_seconds": 21.48,
      "text": "good you can sit up again. Let's get a hearing test for vertigo and hearing loss. I'll start you on betahistine 16 milligrams three times a day long term. You take it by mouth. That's for vertigo. Cut down on salt and caffeine. Come back in six weeks. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.66,
      "end_seconds": 323.07,
